WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:01.729
Good morning Hank, it's Friday.
It's Question Friday,

00:00:01.829 --> 00:00:04.130
the day that I answer real questions from
real Nerdfighters.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:10.430
[Intro music]

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.830
"Are you going to live in Indianapolis forever?"

00:00:12.930 --> 00:00:13.250
Well, no,

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.369
I'm going to spend 
the vast majority of forever deceased.

00:00:15.469 --> 00:00:16.590
"Are you a rebel?"

00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:18.605
No; I've always been for the Empire, 
that's no secret.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:19.810
The world needs order.

00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:21.160
And death stars.

00:00:21.260 --> 00:00:22.310
"Are you aware that, on average,

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:25.550
your videos that do discuss giraffe mating
get ten times more views

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.860
than your videos that don't 
discuss giraffe mating?"

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:30.910
Yeah, I don't know what it is exactly,
but for some reason, as previously noted,

00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:32.930
people love giraffes who love giraffes.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:36.380
Maybe it's because the mating habits of the
giraffe are profoundly fascinating.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.919
For instance, did you know
(and by the way this is all going to be disturbing)

00:00:40.019 --> 00:00:42.390
when boy giraffes wanna have babies 
with girl giraffes,

00:00:42.490 --> 00:00:44.709
the first thing that they do 
is use their heads

00:00:44.809 --> 00:00:47.194
to nudge the girl giraffes in their lady parts.

00:00:47.294 --> 00:00:47.779
They do this

00:00:47.879 --> 00:00:49.960
(and by the way, Hank, 
you may want to put a bucket nearby)

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:54.979
because it causes the girl giraffes to pee,
and then the boy giraffes drink the pee

00:00:55.079 --> 00:00:57.889
because they can taste whether or not the
girl giraffes are ovulating.

00:00:57.989 --> 00:00:59.284
[Gags, coughs]

00:01:00.284 --> 00:01:02.079
Sorry...
I pictured it, I pictured it.

00:01:02.179 --> 00:01:03.299
"Are you thinking what I'm thinking?"

00:01:03.399 --> 00:01:05.589
Ummm...
if you're thinking that urine-swilling giraffe sex

00:01:05.689 --> 00:01:07.569
is the most profoundly unerotic 
thing you've ever heard of,

00:01:07.669 --> 00:01:09.290
then yes. Otherwise,

00:01:09.390 --> 00:01:10.195
you disgust me.

00:01:10.295 --> 00:01:13.060
"Are you trying to take over the world using
muffins and silly string?"

00:01:13.160 --> 00:01:14.120
Hank, we've been found out.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:16.160
"Are you gonna come to my graduation party?"

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:18.100
No, but where is it? I'll send an emissary.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.090
"Are you my father?"

00:01:19.190 --> 00:01:20.280
Let me answer your question with a question:

00:01:20.380 --> 00:01:24.540
Are you a nine-month-old West Highland Terrier
with an indomitable desire to eat shoes?

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:25.595
If not: no.

00:01:25.695 --> 00:01:26.950
"Are you stuck in the labyrinth?"

00:01:27.050 --> 00:01:28.865
In the labyrinth, but not stuck.

00:01:28.965 --> 00:01:30.580
"Are you thinking about writing more books?"

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:33.979
Yes. I am contracted to write at least three
more books, so don't worry.

00:01:34.079 --> 00:01:35.669
"Are you even reading this?"

00:01:35.769 --> 00:01:37.725
Well, I was, but now I'm doing something else.

00:01:37.825 --> 00:01:40.280
"Are you an optimist with regard to 
the future of humanity?"

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:41.829
Well, I'm an optimist in the sense that I think

00:01:41.929 --> 00:01:46.289
our relentless attempt to extinguish the species
will fail for the forseeable future.

00:01:46.289 --> 00:01:47.594
...Yay!

00:01:47.694 --> 00:01:48.899
"Are you Kurt Vonnegut?"

00:01:48.899 --> 00:01:49.875
Dude, I wish!

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.050
"Are you Santa?"

00:01:51.150 --> 00:01:52.575
No! Santa's black.

00:01:52.675 --> 00:01:53.800
"Are you Gandalf?"

00:01:53.900 --> 00:01:55.610
You shall not...

00:01:55.710 --> 00:01:57.220
I mean ,who am I kidding?

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:59.679
My wizard stick is an umbrella. Also,

00:01:59.779 --> 00:02:01.925
[Laughing] I don't think Gandalf 
calls it a wizard stick.

00:02:02.025 --> 00:02:04.070
"Are you King James II of England?"

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.589
Well, I'm not Catholic,
I'm not British,

00:02:05.689 --> 00:02:07.219
and I don't have shoulder-length curly hair-

00:02:07.319 --> 00:02:09.864
and, if I did, I wouldn't part it in the middle.

00:02:09.964 --> 00:02:10.609
"Are you a banana?"

00:02:10.709 --> 00:02:12.460
Oh, come on, these questions 
are just getting stupid,

00:02:12.560 --> 00:02:15.550
like, do I have some kind of 
pale exterior that you can peel away

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:17.485
and then find edible meat inside?

00:02:17.885 --> 00:02:19.419
Oh... yes.

00:02:19.519 --> 00:02:22.355
But, do I thrive in tropical climates?

00:02:22.955 --> 00:02:24.890
Oh my God,  I am a banana.

00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.630
"Are you gonna put Bubbles the Nerdfighting
Puppy in a video soon?"

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:30.945
"Are you Jacques Derrida?"

00:02:31.045 --> 00:02:33.160
Je vais à la bibliothèque

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:37.660
...is the only sentence I know in French.
Therefore, I'm probably not Jacques Derrida.

00:02:37.760 --> 00:02:40.110
"Are you a 40-year old virgin ROFL?"

00:02:40.210 --> 00:02:41.459
...Is a question that was asked

00:02:41.459 --> 00:02:43.830
by someone who doesn't know
the proper placement of question marks.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.269
"Are you gonna do your happy dance
immediately after reading my question?"

00:02:46.369 --> 00:02:50.119
Yes! [Stomping] Yes!

00:02:50.219 --> 00:02:52.269
Hank, happy 2009!

